// P3F.5 (`intro-to-parametric-cad.md` P3.5; `intro-to-parametric-cad-gaps.md`, "P3.5
// simulation"): a linear static analysis of the gap list's cantilever. The Beam
// (`Custom("simulation-beam")`, `cadrs_core::samples::simulation`): 100 × 10 × 10 mm along X,
// Steel - A36 (E = 200 GPa, ν 0.26). Fixed at x = 0, 100 N down (−Z) on the end x = 100:
// Euler–Bernoulli gives a tip deflection PL³/(3EI) = 0.200 mm and a mid-span top-fibre stress
// M·c/I = 30.0 MPa.
// 01 the beam.
// 02 the Simulation panel (right strip): Materials, Loads (0) with + Fixed, + Force, + Pressure,
//    Mesh, Solve.
// 03 + Fixed: the load dialog, the end face x = 0 picked (highlighted; the view turned to see it).
// 04 + Force: the end face x = 100, Along Z, Flip direction (−Z), 100 N; the arrow in the view.
// 05 the Loads list: Fixed 1 (1 face) and Force 1 (100 N along −Z), their glyphs on the beam.
// 06 (P3F.5 judge) + Pressure: the load dialog on the top face, 0.5 MPa typed (then
//    cancelled).
// 07 (P3F.5 judge) Mesh Coarse, Solve: the solve in progress (paused once meshed by a
//    scripted hold): the stage, the progress bar and Cancel.
// 08 the von Mises map on the exaggerated deformed shape with the legend (0 … max MPa), the
//    undeformed edges as an outline, no load glyphs; Results: the elements, max displacement
//    ≈ 0.200 mm, max von Mises, the safety factor.
// 09 the probe at mid-span on the top face: von Mises ≈ 30 MPa.
// 10 Show Displacement: the legend in mm (max ≈ 0.200), the probe near the tip.
// 11 (P3F.5 judge) Show Safety factor: tensile yield ÷ von Mises, red at the smallest (≈ 4.07
//    at the fixed end: 250 MPa ÷ about 61 MPa there, beam theory's M·c/I at x = 0 being 60 MPa)
//    to blue at five times it; the probe reads it.
// 12 (P3F.5 judge) Deformation Actual (×1): the true 0.2 mm, invisible at this scale.
// 13 Deformation Undeformed.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Wait(30),
        Custom("simulation-beam"),
        Wait(120),
        Custom("view 40 25 50 5 5 0.12"),
        Wait(20),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-beam"),
        Click(ui("panel-simulation")),
        WaitFor("simulation-panel"),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("02-simulation-panel"),
        Click(ui("sim-add-fixed")),
        WaitFor("sim-load-dialog"),
        Wait(5),
        Custom("view -40 25 50 5 5 0.12"),
        Wait(20),
        Click(xyz(0, 5, 5)),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("03-fixed-face"),
        Click(ui("sim-load-dialog-accept")),
        Wait(10),
        Custom("view 40 25 50 5 5 0.12"),
        Wait(20),
        Click(ui("sim-add-force")),
        WaitFor("sim-load-dialog"),
        Wait(5),
        Click(xyz(100, 5, 5)),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("sim-load-direction")),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("sim-load-direction-option-3")),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("sim-load-flip-checkbox")),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("sim-load-magnitude-field")),
        Wait(2),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("100 N"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Wait(5),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("04-force-100n-down"),
        Click(ui("sim-load-dialog-accept")),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("05-loads"),
        Click(ui("sim-add-pressure")),
        WaitFor("sim-load-dialog"),
        Wait(5),
        Click(xyz(50, 5, 10)),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("sim-load-magnitude-field")),
        Wait(2),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("0.5 MPa"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Wait(5),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("06-pressure-dialog"),
        Click(ui("sim-load-dialog-cancel")),
        Wait(10),
        Click(ui("sim-mesh")),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("sim-mesh-option-0")),
        Wait(5),
        Custom("sim-hold on"),
        Wait(2),
        Click(ui("sim-solve")),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("07-solving"),
        Custom("sim-hold off"),
        Wait(5),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("08-von-mises"),
        ExpectText("sim-max-displacement-value", "0.2"),
        Hover(xyz(50, 5, 7.5)),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("09-probe-mid-span"),
        Click(ui("sim-show")),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("sim-show-option-1")),
        Wait(10),
        Hover(xyz(96, 5, 2.4)),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("10-displacement"),
        Click(ui("sim-show")),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("sim-show-option-2")),
        Wait(10),
        Hover(xyz(4, 5, 9.5)),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("11-safety-factor"),
        Click(ui("sim-show")),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("sim-show-option-0")),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("sim-deform")),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("sim-deform-option-1")),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("12-deformation-actual"),
        Click(ui("sim-deform")),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("sim-deform-option-0")),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("13-undeformed"),
    ],
)
